ontent": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"import took 0.44754672050476074 s\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "none"}, "message": null, "integration_name": "File Creation", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"import took 0.44754672050476074 s\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}, "hidden_in_chat": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}], "sender": "assistant", "created_at": "2026-09-27T22:22:16.520635Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T22:22:16.520635Z", "attachments": [], "files": [], "parent_message_uuid": "01a0e4ef-d375-70d1-a88a-3d53e544577c"}]},{"uuid": "813de3bc-13e1-4184-bf28-df600aea00b2", "name": "Algorithm optimization to prevent lag", "summary": "", "created_at": "2026-09-28T08:47:44.590476Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-28T08:53:34.900500Z", "account": {"uuid": "8d7882cd-3e98-47cc-a6e7-61494a1ee4ac"}, "chat_messages": [{"uuid": "01a0e732-da42-71ee-96e7-417512455f49", "text": "https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS\n\nmake sure the algorithm is adjusted in order to prevent all lag", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-09-28T08:47:46.106705Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-09-28T08:47:46.106705Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS\n\nmake sure the algorithm is adjusted in order to prevent all lag", "citations": []}], "sender": "human", "created_at": "2026-09-28T08:47:46.106897Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-28T08:47:46.106897Z", "attachments": [], "files": [], "parent_message_uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"}, {"uuid": "01a0e732-da42-7c63-b31c-49889f2ccb5e", "text": "\n```\nThis block is not supported on your current device yet.\n```\n\nI'll look at the kernel source to see where lag could come from.\n```\nThis block is not supported on your current device yet.\n```\n\nI can't make that change yet, because I haven't found the code that's lagging, and I don't want to guess at an \"algorithm\" in a ~10,500-line kernel.\n\n`kernel.cpp` is only a wrapper. It `#include`s twelve files from `kernel_parts/`, and the real logic is in those. The README also lists \"CPU resource optimising\" as a TODO, so there may not be a scheduler or resource-management algorithm yet.\n\nFrom the file names, the likely lag sources are:\n\n- **Rendering** (`02_boot_info_and_graphics_driver.h`, `04_window_system.h`, `10_window_manager_impl.h`): redrawing the whole screen every frame instead of only dirty rectangles, or drawing straight to the framebuffer instead of a back buffer that gets copied once per frame.\n- **Input** (`03_input_ps2_mouse.h`, `05_io_wait_ps2_funcs.h`): busy-wait polling loops, or a slow I/O wait that blocks the main loop.\n- **Disk** (`06_fat32_filesystem_and_explorer.h`, `07_chkdsk_and_hardware.h`): synchronous AHCI or FAT32 reads that stall the UI, with no caching.\n- **Terminal and VM** (`08_tinyvm_compiler_vm.h`, `09_terminal_window.h`): a long-running program or compile step that blocks the event loop.\n- **Main loop** (`11_kernel_main.h`): no frame pacing, or everything running in one serial loop.\n\nWhen does the lag happen: dragging windows, moving the mouse, typing in the terminal, running a compiled program, or disk access? Are you running it in QEMU or Bochs? Once I know, I'll go through the matching `kernel_parts` file and propose specific changes.\n\nIf you paste the relevant file, or the main loop and rendering code, I can start right away. I can only fetch the pages GitHub links to, and the `kernel_parts` file links weren't in what I received.\n\nI also can't promise \"all lag\" is fixable. Some lag comes from the emulator, not the OS code, but I can remove the lag that comes from the code itself.", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-09-28T08:47:46.101175Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-09-28T08:47:46.257150Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Wypia7B5Qwa83ZXZ2NagAg", "name": "web_fetch", "input": {"url": "https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS"}, "message": "Fetching: https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS", "integration_name": "Web Fetch", "integration_icon_url": null, "tool_identifier": null, "icon_name": "globe", "context": null, "display_content": null, "approval_options": null, "approval_key": null, "approval_key_legacy": null, "is_mcp_app": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "mcp_server_url": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-09-28T08:47:47.075104Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-09-28T08:47:47.075160Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01Wypia7B5Qwa83ZXZ2NagAg", "name": "web_fetch", "content": [{"type": "knowledge", "title": "GitHub - synthreason-source/OS: Operating system with tiny C compiler & bochs emulator.", "url": "https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS", "metadata": {"type": "webpage_metadata", "site_domain": "github.com", "favicon_url": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=64&domain=github.com", "site_name": "github"}, "is_missing": false, "text": "---\nmeta-analytics-location: /&lt;user-name&gt;/&lt;repo-name&gt;\nmeta-apple-itunes-app: app-id=1477376905, app-argument=https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS\nmeta-browser-errors-url: https://api.github.com/_private/browser/errors\nmeta-browser-stats-url: https://api.github.com/_private/browser/stats\nmeta-color-scheme: light dark\nmeta-current-catalog-service-hash: f3abb0cc802f3d7b95fc8762b94bdcb13bf39634c40c357301c4aa1d67a256fb\nmeta-description: Operating system with tiny C compiler &amp; bochs emulator. - synthreason-source/OS\nmeta-disable-turbo: false\nmeta-expected-hostname: github.com\nmeta-fb:app_id: 1401488693436528\nmeta-fetch-nonce: v2:1ad3733a-5e0d-e175-1a5a-7798ae3c22d6\nmeta-github-keyboard-shortcuts: repository,copilot\nmeta-go-import: github.com/synthreason-source/OS git https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS.git\nmeta-google-site-verification: Apib7-x98H0j5cPqHWwSMm6dNU4GmODRoqxLiDzdx9I\nm