                               | | [tcc-mob.tar.gz](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc-mob.tar.gz \"tcc-mob.tar.gz\")                                                                                    |                     |                  |\n| [tcc\\_glue.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_glue.cpp \"tcc_glue.cpp\")                                                                                         | | [tcc\\_glue.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_glue.cpp \"tcc_glue.cpp\")                                                                                         |                     |                  |\n| [tcc\\_glue.h](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_glue.h \"tcc_glue.h\")                                                                                               | | [tcc\\_glue.h](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_glue.h \"tcc_glue.h\")                                                                                               |                     |                  |\n| [tcc\\_guest.ld](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_guest.ld \"tcc_guest.ld\")                                                                                         | | [tcc\\_guest.ld](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_guest.ld \"tcc_guest.ld\")                                                                                         |                     |                  |\n| [tcc\\_kernel.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_kernel.cpp \"tcc_kernel.cpp\")                                                                                   | | [tcc\\_kernel.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_kernel.cpp \"tcc_kernel.cpp\")                                                                                   |                     |                  |\n| [tcc\\_stub.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_stub.cpp \"tcc_stub.cpp\")                                                                                         | | [tcc\\_stub.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_stub.cpp \"tcc_stub.cpp\")                                                                                         |                     |                  |\n| [tcc\\_stub.zip](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_stub.zip \"tcc_stub.zip\")                                                                                         | | [tcc\\_stub.zip](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/tcc_stub.zip \"tcc_stub.zip\")                                                                                         |                     |                  |\n| [test\\_main.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_main.cpp \"test_main.cpp\")                                                                                      | | [test\\_main.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_main.cpp \"test_main.cpp\")                                                                                      |                     |                  |\n| [test\\_module.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_module.cpp \"test_module.cpp\")                                                                                | | [test\\_module.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_module.cpp \"test_module.cpp\")                                                                                |                     |                  |\n| [test\\_module.h](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_module.h \"test_module.h\")                                                                                      | | [test\\_module.h](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_module.h \"test_module.h\")                                                                                      |                     |                  |\n| [test\\_module\\_stub.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_module_stub.cpp \"test_module_stub.cpp\")                                                                | | [test\\_module\\_stub.cpp](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/blob/main/test_module_stub.cpp \"test_module_stub.cpp\")                                                                |                     |                  |\n| View all files                                                                                                                                                        | | |\n\n## Repository files navigation\n\n-\n- [README](#)\n\nMore items\n\na simple GUI interface OS with terminal windows, TCC compiler & bochs emulator.\n\nCTRL-Q saves and exits text editor...\n\nSATA port selection with 'disk_select'\n\nguest programs require drivers.h and comp.h to interface with the OS.\n\nTODO: add ethernet, web browser & busybox implementation\nTODO: add driver kit, CPU resource optimising\n\n# Build Instructions\n\n[#build-instructions](#build-instructions)\n\n## Prerequisites (one-time apt installs)\n\n[#prerequisites-one-time-apt-installs](#prerequisites-one-time-apt-installs)\n\n```\nsudo apt update\nsudo apt install make gcc g++ gcc-multilib g++-multilib gcc-13-multilib \\\n    binutils binutils-multiarch grub-common grub-pc-bin \\\n    xorriso mtools qemu-system-x86 build-essential nasm \\\n    libncurses-dev bison flex git bc libssl-dev \\\n    xorg-dev libx11-dev\n```\n> **Note:** `binutils-multiarch` is required for `ld -m elf_i386` used by\n> the TCC guest linker step. TCC itself is built from source automatically\n> (see below) \u2014 no `apt install tcc` needed.\n---\n\n## TCC: download and build (one-time, automatic)\n\n[#tcc-download-and-build-one-time-automatic](#tcc-download-and-build-one-time-automatic)\n\nTCC (Tiny C Compiler) is fetched from GitHub and built locally into `tcc-local/`. This gives you `i386-tcc` (cross-compiler targeting 32-bit\ni386) and `libtcc.a` (for `tcc_tool`).\n\n```\nmake setup-tcc        # downloads source, builds, installs into tcc-local/\n```\n\nTo remove the local TCC build and start fresh:\n\n```\nmake tcc-clean        # removes tcc-local/, tcc-src/, tcc-mob.tar.gz\n```\n\n---\n\n## Full kernel build\n\n[#full-kernel-build](#full-kernel-build)\n\n```\nmake clean\nrm -rf bochs-2.0 bochs-2.0-src.tar.gz tcc-src tcc-local i386-libtcc-kern.a i386-libtcc.a\nmake\n```\n\nRun in QEMU:\n\n```\nqemu-system-i386 -M q35 -m 2048M -vga std \\\n    -drive id=cd0,file=main.iso,format=raw,if=none,media=cdrom \\\n    -drive id=disk0,file=disk.img,format=raw,if=none \\\n    -device ahci,id=ahci \\\n    -device ide-cd,drive=cd0,bus=ahci.0 \\\n    -device ide-hd,drive=disk0,bus=ahci.1 \\\n    -boot d\n```\n\n## About\n\nOperating system with tiny C compiler & bochs emulator.\n\n### Topics\n\n[bochs](https://github.com/topics/bochs)[bochscpu](https://github.com/topics/bochscpu)[kernel](https://github.com/topics/kernel)[operating-system](https://github.com/topics/operating-system)[os](https://github.com/topics/os)[terminal](https://github.com/topics/terminal)\n\n### Resources\n\n[Readme](#readme-ov-file)\n\n[Activity](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/activity)\n\n### Stars\n\n**0** stars\n\n### Watchers\n\n**0** watching\n\n### Forks\n\n[**0** forks](https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS/forks)\n\n[Report repository](https://github.com/contact/report-content?content_url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fsynthreason-source%2FOS&report=synthreason-source+%28user%29)\n\n## Releases\n\n## Packages\n\n## Contributors\n\n## Languages\n\n## Footer\n\n[https://github.com](https://github.com) \u00a9 2026 GitHub, Inc.\n\n### Footer navigation\n\n- [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\n- [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\n- [Security](https://github.com/security)\n- [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\n- [Community](https://github.community/)\n- [Docs](https://docs.github.com/)\n- [Contact](https://support.github.com?tags=dotcom-footer)\n- Manage cookies\n\n- Do not share my personal information", "is_citable": true, "prompt_context_metadata": {"content_type": "html", "destination_url": "https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS", "mime_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"}, "links": null}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": null, "message": "Fetched: GitHub - synthreason-source/OS: Operating system with tiny C compiler & bochs emulator.", "integration_name": "Web Fetch", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=64&domain=github.com", "icon_name": "globe", "display_content": {"type": "rich_link", "link": {"title": "GitHub - synthreason-source/OS: Operating system with tiny C compiler & bochs emulator.", "subtitles": null, "url": "https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS", "resource_type": null, "icon_url": "https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?sz=64&domain=github.com", "source": "github"}, "is_trusted": false}, "hidden_in_chat": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-07T10:12:26.597350Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-07T10:12:26.597505Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "The repo's guest programs rely on `comp.h` and `drivers.h`, so I'll clone it and read those interfaces before writing the renderer.", "citations": []}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-07T10:12:26.597509Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-07T10:12:29.367223Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01SKHQsTgDhRCoyMyCzrpC5S", "name": "bash_tool", "input": {"command": "cd /home/claude && git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/synthreason-source/OS.git 2>&1 | tail -3; cd OS 2>/dev/null && ls -la | head -100 && wc -l comp.h drivers.h driver.h editf.c gui_demo.c mkfat32.py DISK_WRAPPER.md compile.md Makefile 2>&1", "description": "Clone the repo and list ke