nches](https://github.com/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/branches)[/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/tags](https://github.com/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/tags)\n\nGo to file\n\nCode\n\nOpen more actions menu\n\n## Latest commit\n\n\u00a0\n\n## History\n\n[1,098 Commits](https://github.com/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/commits/main/)\n\n[/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/commits/main/](https://github.com/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/commits/main/)1,098 Commits\n\n## Folders and files\n\n| Name                                                                                                                                                                                                     | | Name                                                                                                                                                                                                     | Last commit message | Last commit date |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ---------------- |\n| [Artificial Intelligence - A Modern Approach (3rd Edition).txt](https://github.com/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/blob/main/Artificial%20Intelligence%20-%20A%20Modern%20Approach%20(3rd%20Edition).txt \"Artificial Intelligence - A Modern Approach (3rd Edition).txt\") | | [Artificial Intelligence - A Modern Approach (3rd Edition).txt](https://github.com/synthreason-source/Pi-Transformer/blob/main/Artificial%20Intelligence%20-%20A%20Modern%20Approach%20(3rd%20Edition).txt \"Artificial Intelligence - A Modern Approach (3rd Edition).txt\") |                     |            