..##.  .###.##.  ........  ...##...\\n........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........\\n\\n)         *         +         ,         -         .         /         :       \\n.##.....  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  .....##.  ........\\n..##....  .##..##.  ..##....  ........  ........  ........  ....##..  ..##....\\n...##...  ..####..  ..##....  ........  ........  ........  ...##...  ..##....\\n...##...  ########  ######..  ........  ######..  ........  ..##....  ........\\n...##...  ..####..  ..##....  ........  ........  ........  .##.....  ........\\n..##....  .##..##.  ..##....  ..##....  ........  ..##....  ##......  ..##....\\n.##.....  ........  ........  ..##....  ........  ..##....  #.......  ..##....\\n........  ........  ........  .##.....  ........  ........  ........  ........\\n\\n;         <         =         >         ?         @         [         \\\\       \\n........  ...##...  ........  .##.....  .####...  .#####..  .####...  ##......\\n..##....  ..##....  ........  ..##....  ##..##..  ##...##.  .##.....  .##.....\\n..##....  .##.....  ######..  ...##...  ....##..  ##.####.  .##.....  ..##....\\n........  ##......  ........  ....##..  ...##...  ##.####.  .##.....  ...##...\\n........  .##.....  ........  ...##...  ..##....  ##.####.  .##.....  ....##..\\n..##....  ..##....  ######..  ..##....  ........  ##......  .##.....  .....##.\\n..##....  ...##...  ........  .##.....  ..##....  .####...  .####...  ......#.\\n.##.....  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........\\n\\n]         ^         _         `         {         |         }         ~       \\n.####...  ...#....  ........  ..##....  ...###..  ...##...  ###.....  .###.##.\\n...##...  ..###...  ........  ..##....  ..##....  ...##...  ..##....  ##.###..\\n...##...  .##.##..  ........  ...##...  ..##....  ...##...  ..##....  ........\\n...##...  ##...##.  ........  ........  ###.....  ...##...  ...###..  ........\\n...##...  ........  ........  ........  ..##....  ...##...  ..##....  ........\\n...##...  ........  ........  ........  ..##....  ...##...  ..##....  ........\\n.####...  ........  ........  ........  ...###..  ...##...  ###.....  ........\\n........  ........  ########  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........\\n\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "none"}, "message": null, "integration_name": "File Creation", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"128\\nblank printable: []\\n!         \\\"         #         $         %         &         '         (       \\n...##...  .##.##..  .##.##..  ..##....  ........  ..###...  .##.....  ...##...\\n..####..  .##.##..  .##.##..  .#####..  ##...##.  .##.##..  .##.....  ..##....\\n..####..  ........  #######.  ##......  ##..##..  ..###...  ##......  .##.....\\n...##...  ........  .##.##..  .####...  ...##...  .###.##.  ........  .##.....\\n...##...  ........  #######.  ....##..  ..##....  ##.###..  ........  .##.....\\n........  ........  .##.##..  #####...  .##..##.  ##..##..  ........  ..##....\\n...##...  ........  .##.##..  ..##....  ##...##.  .###.##.  ........  ...##...\\n........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........\\n\\n)         *         +         ,         -         .         /         :       \\n.##.....  ........  ........  ........  ........  ........  .....##.  ........\\n..##....  .##..##.  ..##....  ........  ........  ........  ....##..  ..##....\\n...##...  ..####..  ..##....  ........  ........  ........  ...##...  ..##....\\n...##...  ########  ######..  ........  ######..  ........  ..##....  ........\\n...##...  ..####..  ..##....  ........  ........  ........  .##.....  ........\\n..##....  .##..##.  ..##....  ..##....  ........  ..##....  ##......  ..##....\\n.##.....  