 (expect <0)\\nrc=0\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}, "hidden_in_chat": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-15T22:34:19.427503Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-15T22:34:23.401437Z", "flags": null, "type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "summaries": [{"summary": "Testing a GUI scene editor's parsing and rejection logic."}], "cut_off": false, "truncated": true, "hidden": false, "thinking_hidden": true, "alternative_display_type": null, "signature": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-15T22:34:23.401558Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-15T22:34:23.401813Z", "flags": null, "type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "summaries": [{"summary": "Running smoke tests on the driverkit and web programs"}], "cut_off": false, "truncated": true, "hidden": false, "thinking_hidden": true, "alternative_display_type": null, "signature": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-15T22:34:23.401875Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-15T22:34:26.836955Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_018sgtxhqXd3ZgQHWmUQdXK8", "name": "bash_tool", "input": {"command": "cd /tmp/g && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'/tmp/g')\nfrom emu import *\nIN=0x10\nfor name,disk in [('driverkit',{}),('web',{'index.htm':b'<html><body><h1>Hello</h1><p>Test page <a href=\"editf.c\">editf.c</a></p></body></html>','editf.c':b'int x;\\n'})]:\n    g=Guest(f'/tmp/g/{name}.elf'); g.disk=dict(disk); r=g.run_frames(4); base=g.px()\n    bad=[]; changed=0; steps=0\n    pts=[(x,y) for y in range(10,200,25) for x in range(10,320,40)]\n    for (x,y) in pts:\n        g.mx,g.my=x,y; g.btn=IN; r=g.step()\n        g.btn=IN|1; g.click_once=True; r2=g.step(); g.btn=IN; r3=g.step(); steps+=3\n        for rr in (r,r2,r3):\n            if rr!='frame' and not g.exited: bad.append((x,y,rr))\n        if g.exited: break\n        if diff(base,g.px())>50: changed+=1\n    for k in list(\"abc123!?\\n\")+[8,255,254,253,252]:\n        g.keys.append(k if isinstance(k,int) else ord(k))\n    for _ in range(6):\n        r=g.step()\n        if r!='frame' and not g.exited: bad.append(('key',r))\n    print(f\"{name:10s} {len(pts)} click positions, {steps} frames: faults/hangs={bad[:3]} exited={g.exited} canvases that differed from idle={changed} final={r}\")\nEOF", "description": "Smoke-test driverkit and web with click sweep and keys"}, "message": "Smoke-test driverkit and web with click sweep and keys", "integration_name": "File Creation", "integration_icon_url": null, "tool_identifier": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "context": null, "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"language\": \"bash\", \"code\": \"cd /tmp/g && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'/tmp/g')\\nfrom emu import *\\nIN=0x10\\nfor name,disk in [('driverkit',{}),('web',{'index.htm':b'<html><body><h1>Hello</h1><p>Test page <a href=\\\"editf.c\\\">editf.c</a></p></body></html>','editf.c':b'int x;\\\\n'})]:\\n    g=Guest(f'/tmp/g/{name}.elf'); g.disk=dict(disk); r=g.run_frames(4); base=g.px()\\n    bad=[]; changed=0; steps=0\\n    pts=[(x,y) for y in range(10,200,25) for x in range(10,320,40)]\\n    for (x,y) in pts:\\n        g.mx,g.my=x,y; g.btn=IN; r=g.step()\\n        g.btn=IN|1; g.click_once=True; r2=g.step(); g.btn=IN; r3=g.step(); steps+=3\\n        for rr in (r,r2,r3):\\n            if rr!='frame' and not g.exited: bad.append((x,y,rr))\\n        if g.exited: break\\n        if diff(base,g.px())>50: changed+=1\\n    for k in list(\\\"abc123!?\\\\n\\\")+[8,255,254,253,252]:\\n        g.keys.append(k if isinstance(k,int) else ord(k))\\n    for _ in range(6):\\n        r=g.step()\\n        if r!='frame' and not g.exited: bad.append(('key',r))\\n    print(f\\\"{name:10s} {len(pts)} click positions, {steps} frames: faults/hangs={bad[:3]} exited={g.exited} canvases that differed from idle={changed} final={r}\\\")\\nEOF\"}"}, "approval_options": null, "approval_key": null, "approval_key_legacy": null, "is_mcp_app": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "mcp_server_url": null, "tool_origin": "fi