OR    : 129 / 148\\n  FA sum=47  FA carry=40  MUX=40  ripple \u03a3=318  overflow=10\\n  null 'rotate' done (199 perms)\\n  null 'ring-joint' done (499 perms)\\n  null 'ring-indep' done (499 perms)\\n  null 'row-roll' done (499 perms)\\n  null 'D4-symmetry' done (499 perms)\\n  null 'probe-swap' done (499 perms)\\n\\nz-scores (obs vs null), * = significant after BH-FDR 5%:\\n                             rotate   ring-joint   ring-indep     row-roll  D4-symmetry   probe-swap\\nBUF(A)                         -1.3        -5.9*        -6.0*        -3.9*    invariant        -4.3*\\nNOT(A)                         +1.3        +5.9*        +6.0*        +3.9*    invariant        +4.3*\\nAND                            -1.2        -5.9*         +2.2        -3.9*    invariant    invariant\\nOR                             -0.9        -3.8*        -9.8*         -2.2    invariant    invariant\\nNAND                           +1.2        +5.9*         -2.2        +3.9*    invariant    invariant\\nNOR                            +0.9        +3.8*        +9.8*         +2.2    invariant    invariant\\nXOR                            -0.1         +1.6        -7.5*         +1.9    invariant    invariant\\nXNOR                           +0.1         -1.6        +7.5*         -1.9    invariant    invariant\\nFA sum (parity)                -1.6    invariant       -10.1*    invariant    invariant    invariant\\nFA carry (2-of-3)              +0.3    invariant       +10.1*    invariant    invariant    invariant\\nMUX(SH;TH,BR)                  +0.2    invariant         -0.3    invariant    invariant        -4.4*\\nRipple sum (4b words)          -0.7         -0.5         -0.7         -1.1         -0.9    invariant\\nRipple overflow                +0.6         +0.5        +6.9*         +0.2         +1.3    invariant\\n\\nSaved sic_wafer_macro_gates.png, sic_wafer_permutations.png\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "none"}, 