rd\\n[  19]    'o' gate=rules+plan          |G|=  2 plan=write_words(19/90) ctx='the|ro'               rules=bigram_word\\n[  20]    'f' gate=rules+plan          |G|=  1 plan=write_words(20/90) ctx='the|roo'              rules=bigram_word\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "none"}, "message": null, "integration_name": "File Creation", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"\\n--- GENERATED TEXT ---\\n\\nOnce upon and again and nobody asked me that before the village watched the village learned the stranger. A small brown fox mended the storm gather over the storm gather over the stars one by one, though the nets before!\\n\\\" \\\"\\n\\\" \\\" \\\"said Mara's grandfather told the nets before the stars one by one by one by one.\\\" Where do the nets before the storm gather over the same story again and again. A small brown fox wa \\n\\n[logic] 400 gated steps | gates: rules+plan=363, rules (plan yields)=37\\n[logic] lexicon: 111 word types, 106 bigram contexts\\n[logic] rules that shaped the gate: bigram_initials=80, bigram_word=235, capital_opens_sentence=8, close_open_quote=1, lexical_word=77, no_double_punct=1, no_double_space=77, no_early_end=82, no_space_before_punct=77, space_after_close_quote=3, space_after_end=3\\n[logic] relaxed (would have emptied the gate): no_echo=4\\n[logic] plan cycles completed: 4; current plan: gap -> capitalise -> write_words -> terminate\\n[logic] rules that never changed the gate: break_long_word, no_run_on, no_stray_closer, match_closer, close_before_end, lexical_initials, no_stutter, no_echo\\n----\\nplan: write_words -> terminate\\n[   0]    'n' gate=rules+plan          |G|=  7 plan=write_words(0/90)  ctx='upon|a'               rules=no_early_end,lexical_word\\n[   1]    'd' gate=rules+plan          |G|=  2 plan=write_words(1/90