skeleton.pdf.\n\nBecause the endoskeleton is a tall image and the tank was wide, I made its frame narrower and taller. The caption \"Polycrystalline hadronic matter chassis\" stays under it, and the text below moved down about 69 pt to make room. The rest of the layout and page 2 are unchanged.\n\nThe brochure's text still says \"chassis\" and \"vehicle platform\" in places. I can reword those for a robot frame if you'd like.", "citations": []}], "sender": "assistant", "created_at": "2026-10-20T10:02:07.712227Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T10:02:07.712227Z", "attachments": [], "files": [{"file_uuid": "e6ba33c1-4bbf-5046-99d9-c8ea3e7bbe68", "file_name": "pg-1.png"}, {"file_uuid": "98b560ea-ee25-57a7-9dc7-55700b4cc217", "file_name": "emb-000.png"}, {"file_uuid": "aace4dd3-ba3c-5f6c-8cde-9f32a3ca7ada", "file_name": "new_combined.png"}, {"file_uuid": "930d4570-2eec-569f-92bd-598c708f2d86", "file_name": "out-1.png"}], "parent_message_uuid": "01a158c1-890a-73be-91a0-bf06c807b58e"}]},{"uuid": "21cded7b-a87f-4fff-bb11-273f86dba070", "name": "Counting total inputs and outputs", "summary": "", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:46:33.424133Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T22:46:55.800960Z", "account": {"uuid": "8d7882cd-3e98-47cc-a6e7-61494a1ee4ac"}, "chat_messages": [{"uuid": "01a15b7e-b46f-77c8-88df-e39a6e4a084a", "text": "count the total inputs and output amounts of both and present them individually", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:34.917348Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:34.917348Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "count the total inputs and output amounts of both and present them individually", "citations": []}], "sender": "human", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:46:34.917718Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T22:46:34.917718Z", "attachments": [{"file_name": "doordash.txt", "file_size": 10155, "file_type": "text/plain", "extracted_content": "Orders\r\nCompleted\r\n11 Oct\r\nBWS\r\n$39.95 \u2022 2 items \u2022 Personal\r\nPoco Vino Sauvignon Blanc (187 ml