g) \u2022 Doritos Medium Salsa (300 g) \u2022 Arnott's Original Crackers Pizza Shapes (190 g)\r\nRefund Issued\r\n31 July 2025\r\nColes\r\n$62.27 \u2022 8 items \u2022 Personal\r\nNescafe Espresso Coffee Concentrate Black (500 ml) \u2022 Coles White Sugar (2 kg) \u2022 Urban Coffee Culture Freeze Dried Instant Coffee (100 g) \u2022 Lipton Black Tea Bags (100 pk)\r\nMcDonald's\r\n$43.98 \u2022 1 item \u2022 Personal\r\nMacca's Bundle For 2\r\n18 July 2025\r\nMcDonald's\r\n$39.62 \u2022 1 item \u2022 Personal\r\nMacca's Bundle For 2\r\n15 July 2025\r\nColes\r\n$27.83 \u2022 3 items \u2022 Personal\r\nMusashi Purple Grape Energy Drink (500 ml)\r\nRefund Issued\r\n3 July 2025\r\nMcDonald's\r\n$39.62 \u2022 1 item \u2022 Personal\r\nMacca's Bundle For 2\r\n25 June 2025\r\nMcDonald's\r\n$36.49 \u2022 2 items \u2022 Personal\r\nMacca's Footy Bundle\r\n19 June 2025\r\nColes\r\n$39.44 \u2022 2 items \u2022 Personal\r\nMonster Zero Ultra Energy Drink Cans (500 ml x 4 pk)\r\n6 June 2025\r\nAPCO Easy Shop\r\n$33.60 \u2022 2 items \u2022 Personal\r\nRed Bull Energy Drink Cans 250ml 4 Pack\r\nAmalfi Pizza & Pasta\r\n$42.68 \u2022 3 items \u2022 Personal\r\nPepperoni \u2022 Garlic Bread Roll\r\n5 June 2025\r\nMcDonald's\r\n$65.51 \u2022 10 items \u2022 Personal\r\nCheeseburger \u2022 Macca's Footy Bundle\r\n\r\n\r\n72 items\r\n"}], "files": [{"file_uuid": "e71bb252-03fe-4c4a-a6e0-d9d75a1718b9", "file_name": "sendsreceives.csv"}, {"file_uuid": "38d86627-4bd6-55d2-953f-5078dcef5e27", "file_name": "doordash.txt"}], "parent_message_uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"}, {"uuid": "01a15b7e-b46f-70be-9d37-2d1c2ae12a57", "text": "I'll start by looking at the CSV, since its contents aren't in my context yet.\n```\nThis block is not supported on your current device yet.\n```\n\n\n```\nThis block is not supported on your current device yet.\n```\n\n\n```\nThis block is not supported on your current device yet.\n```\n\nI read both files in full. I'm assuming \"inputs\" means money coming in and \"outputs\" means money going out, with the crypto file as \"sends/receives\" and the DoorDash file as \"orders\".\n\n## 1. Crypto (sendsreceives.csv)\nThis covers 178 completed transactions from 3 Nov 2025 to 19 Oct 2026. Values are the AUD figures recorded in the file.\n\n| | Count | AUD value |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Inputs (Receives)** | 29 | **$226.77** |\n| **Outputs (Sends)** | 149 | **$5,631.31** |\n| **Net outflow** | | **$5,404.54** |\n\nBreakdown by coin:\n\n| Coin | Received (AUD) | Sent (AUD) | Amount sent | Network fees paid |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| DOGE | $158.59 (26 txns) | $2,419.88 (78 txns) | 16,855.08 | 312 DOGE |\n| BCH | $42.08 (1) | $2,322.18 (51) | 4.3497 | 0.0102 BCH |\n| USDT | $16.21 (1) | $553.04 (13) | 381.16 | 2.45 USDT |\n| BTC | $9.89 (1) | $332.81 (6) | 0.0031 | 0.00011 BTC |\n| ADA | \u2013 | $3.40 (1) | 10.36 | 0.8 ADA |\n\n- Three of the DOGE receives are labelled \"Receive from matthiesabrett@gmail.com\". I counted them as receives, and they total $43.54 of the $226.77.\n- The fees are in each coin's own units. The file doesn't give an AUD value for them, so I haven't added them to the totals.\n\n## 2. DoorDash (doordash.txt)\nThis covers 72 orders from 5 June 2025 to 11 Oct 2026. All of them are outputs, because the file has no money coming in.\n\n| | Count | AUD |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Outputs (order totals)** | 72 | **$3,699.15** |\n| Orders marked \"Refund Issued\" | 4 | $135.40 |\n| **Net if all 4 were refunded in full** | | **$3,563.75** |\n\nThe four refunded orders are ALDI ($38.16), Reddy Express ($31.23), Coles on 6 Aug 2025 ($38.18) and Coles on 15 Jul 2025 ($27.83). The file doesn't say whether each refund was full or partial, so the net figure is an estimate. A few orders have a name like \"hj[CHURNED - DO NOT REACTIVATE]\" in the restaurant field. I counted them as normal orders.\n\n## Combined\n- **Total outputs:** $5,631.31 + $3,699.15 = **$9,330.46**\n- **Total inputs:** **$226.77**\n\nI can also put this in a spreadsheet or split it by month if that would help.", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:34.807885Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:35.891549Z", "flags": null, "type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "summaries": [{"summary": "Reviewing uploaded transaction records for Doordash activity."}], "cut_off": false, "truncated": true, "hidden": false, "thinking_hidden": true, "alternative_display_type": null, "signature": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:35.891579Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:36.159045Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "I'll start by looking at the CSV, since its contents aren't in my context yet.", "citations": []}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:36.159122Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:36.565474Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01BtEeL8FG2CGpMowLj5icfT", "name": "bash_tool", "input": {"command": "cd /mnt/user-data/uploads; wc -l sendsreceives.csv; head -30 sendsreceives.csv", "description": "Inspect CSV"}, "message": "Inspect CSV", "integration_name": "File Creation", "integration_icon_url": null, "tool_identifier": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "context": null, "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"language\": \"bash\", \"code\": \"cd /mnt/user-data/uploads; wc -l sendsreceives.csv; head -30 sendsreceives.csv\"}"}, "approval_options": null, "approval_key": null, "approval_key_legacy": null, "is_mcp_app": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "mcp_server_url": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:37.773206Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:37.773282Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01BtEeL8FG2CGpMowLj5icfT", "name": "bash_tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"179 sendsreceives.csv\\n\\\"Transaction Date\\\",\\\"Type\\\",\\\"Coin\\\",\\\"Status\\\",\\\"Fee\\\",\\\"Amount\\\",\\\"Address\\\",\\\"Txid\\\",\\\"Aud\\\"\\r\\n19/10/2026 12:56 PM,