g", "thinking": "", "summaries": [{"summary": "Counting DoorDash orders to verify the total."}], "cut_off": false, "truncated": true, "hidden": false, "thinking_hidden": true, "alternative_display_type": null, "signature": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:46.913524Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:48.066932Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01XjAiLjkh5o6sZw8cWzSHNs", "name": "bash_tool", "input": {"command": "cd /mnt/user-data/uploads; python3 - <<'E'\nimport pandas as pd\npd.set_option('display.width',200)\nd=pd.read_csv('sendsreceives.csv')\nd['T']=d.Type.str.split().str[0]\ng=d.groupby(['T','Coin']).agg(n=('Aud','size'),amt=('Amount','sum'),aud=('Aud','sum'),fee=('Fee','sum'))\nprint(g.round(4))\nprint(d.groupby('T').Aud.agg(['size','sum']))\nE", "description": "Per-coin breakdown"}, "message": "Per-coin breakdown", "integration_name": "File Creation", "integration_icon_url": null, "tool_identifier": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "context": null, "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"language\": \"bash\", \"code\": \"cd /mnt/user-data/uploads; python3 - <<'E'\\nimport pandas as pd\\npd.set_option('display.width',200)\\nd=pd.read_csv('sendsreceives.csv')\\nd['T']=d.Type.str.split().str[0]\\ng=d.groupby(['T','Coin']).agg(n=('Aud','size'),amt=('Amount','sum'),aud=('Aud','sum'),fee=('Fee','sum'))\\nprint(g.round(4))\\nprint(d.groupby('T').Aud.agg(['size','sum']))\\nE\"}"}, "approval_options": null, "approval_key": null, "approval_key_legacy": null, "is_mcp_app": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "mcp_server_url": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:48.651224Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:48.651277Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01XjAiLjkh5o6sZw8cWzSHNs", "name": "bash_tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"               n         amt        aud       fee\\nT       Coin                                     \\nReceive BCH    1      0.1046    42.0840    0.0000\\n        BTC    1      0.0001     9.8863    0.0000\\n        DOGE  26   1206.5221   158.5930    0.0000\\n        USDT   1     11.5918    16.2116    0.0000\\nSend    ADA    1    -10.3629     3.3996    0.8000\\n        BCH   51     -4.3497  2322.1848    0.0102\\n        BTC    6     -0.0031   332.8059    0.0001\\n        DOGE  78 -16855.0809  2419.8762  312.0000\\n        USDT  13   -381.1577   553.0433    2.4500\\n         size          sum\\nT                         \\nReceive    29   226.774790\\nSend      149  5631.309779\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "none"}, "message": null, "integration_name": "File Creation", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "commandLine", "display_content": {"type": "json_block", "json_block": "{\"returncode\":0,\"stdout\":\"               n         amt        aud       fee\\nT       Coin                                     \\nReceive BCH    1      0.1046    42.0840    0.0000\\n        BTC    1      0.0001     9.8863    0.0000\\n        DOGE  26   1206.5221   158.5930    0.0000\\n        USDT   1     11.5918    16.2116    0.0000\\nSend    ADA    1    -10.3629     3.3996    0.8000\\n        BCH   51     -4.3497  2322.1848    0.0102\\n        BTC    6     -0.0031   332.8059    0.0001\\n        DOGE  78 -16855.0809  2419.8762  312.0000\\n        USDT  13   -381.1577   553.0433    2.4500\\n         size          sum\\nT                         \\nReceive    29   226.774790\\nSend      149  5631.309779\\n\",\"stderr\":\"\"}"}, "hidden_in_chat": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:55.574985Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:46:55.732441Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "I read both files in full. I'm assuming \"inputs\" means money coming in and \"outputs\" means money going out, with the crypto file as \"sends/receives\" and the DoorDash file as \"orders\".\n\n## 1. Crypto (sendsreceives.csv)\nThis covers 178 completed transactions from 3 Nov 2025 to 19 Oct 2026. Values are the AUD figures recorded in the file.\n\n| | Count | AUD value |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Inputs (Receives)** | 29 | **$226.77** |\n| **Outputs (Sends)** | 149 | **$5,631.31** |\n| **Net outflow** | | **$5,404.54** |\n\nBreakdown by coin:\n\n| Coin | Received (AUD) | Sent (AUD) | Amount sent | Network fees paid |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| DOGE | $158.59 (26 txns) | $2,419.88 (78 txns) | 16,855.08 | 312 DOGE |\n| BCH | $42.08 (1) | $2,322.18 (51) | 4.3497 | 0.0102 BCH |\n| USDT | $16.21 (1) | $553.04 (13) | 381.16 | 2.45 USDT |\n| BTC | $9.89 (1) | $332.81 (6) | 0.0031 | 0.00011 BTC |\n| ADA | \u2013 | $3.40 (1) | 10.36 | 0.8 ADA |\n\n- Three of the DOGE receives are labelled \"Receive from matthiesabrett@gmail.com\". I counted them as receives, and they total $43.54 of the $226.77.\n- The fees are in each coin's own units. The file doesn't give an AUD value for them, so I haven't added them to the totals.\n\n## 2. DoorDash (doordash.txt)\nThis covers 72 orders from 5 June 2025 to 11 Oct 2026. All of them are outputs, because the file has no money coming in.\n\n| | Count | AUD |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Outputs (order totals)** | 72 | **$3,699.15** |\n| Orders marked \"Refund Issued\" | 4 | $135.40 |\n| **Net if all 4 were refunded in full** | | **$3,563.75** |\n\nThe four refunded orders are ALDI ($38.16), Reddy Express ($31.23), Coles on 6 Aug 2025 ($38.18) and Coles on 15 Jul 2025 ($27.83). The file doesn't say whether each refund was full or partial, so the net figure is an estimate. A few orders have a name like \"hj[CHURNED - DO NOT REACTIVATE]\" in the restaurant field. I counted them as normal orders.\n\n## Combined\n- **Total outputs:** $5,631.31 + $3,699.15 = **$9,330.46**\n- **Total inputs:** **$226.77**\n\nI can also put this in a spreadsheet or split it by month if that would help.", "citations": []}], "sender": "assistant", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:46:55.800960Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T22:46:55.800960Z", "attachments": [], "files": [], "parent_message_uuid": "01a15b7e-b46f-77c8-88df-e39a6e4a084a"}]},{"uuid": "02276da0-0b5e-4d10-87eb-847b4e5d3602", "name": "Video game purchase history analysis", "summary": "", "created_at": "2026-10-21T00:08:21.480196Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T00:08:34.495554Z", "account": {"uuid": "8d7882cd-3e98-47cc-a6e7-61494a1ee4ac"}, "chat_messages": [{"uuid": "01a15bc9-9577-7247-bc7e-dc83e2f094a2", "text": "Attachment games.txt added.\n\nSkip to content\nUsing Gmail with screen readers\nMessage sent\n \n4 of 784\nFinancial Records\nInbox\n\nGeorge Wagenknecht\nAttachments\n10:15\u202fAM (50 minutes ago)\nHi, here's my receipts for the past year.\n\nGeorge Wagenknecht <georgewagenknecht1@gmail.com>\nAttachments\n10:17\u202fAM (48 minutes ago)\nto me, FASupport\n\nFor George Wagenknecht, 386-392 High Street, Golden Square.\n One attachment\n  \u2022  Scanned by Gmail\n\nGeorge Wagenknecht\nAttachments\n11:02\u202fAM (3 minutes ago)\nto me, FASupport\n\n One attachment\n  \u2022  Scanned by Gmail\n\nGeorge Wagenknecht\n11:06\u202fAM (0 minutes ago)\nto me, FASupport\n\nActual history:\n\ngeorgew11011101's Purchase History\nProblem with a transaction? Select it below to get help.\nDate\tItems\tType\tPrice\tTax\tShipping\tTotal\tWallet\nChange\tBalance\n27 Jul, 2026\t\nAtomcraft\nPurchase\nVisa **60\n-20%\nA$ 16.99 A$ 13.59\nA$ 13.59\t\t\n23 Apr, 2026\t\nDesynced\nStarRupture\nPurchase\nVisa **68\n-26%\nA$ 72.94 A$ 53.95\nA$ 53.95\t\t\n18 Dec, 2025\t\nHELLDIVERS\u2122 2\nPurchase\nVisa **68\nA$ 59.95\t\t\tA$ 59.95\t\t\n15 Dec, 2025\t\nArc Raiders\nPurchase\nVisa **68\nA$ 60.78\t\t\tA$ 60.78\t\t\n13 Jan, 2025\t\nPlanetbase\nPrison Architect\nPurchase\nVisa **68\nA$ 64.90\t\t\tA$ 64.90\t\t\n7 Jan, 2025\t\nSpace Engineers\nPurchase\nVisa **68\nA$ 28.95\t\t\tA$ 28.95\t\t\n30 Dec, 2024\t\nDOOM Eternal Standard Edition\nPurchase\nVisa **68\n-75%\nA$ 54